#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:5 865897cda8d74b869818d10265e765ff
msgid "Indoor Flying Guidelines"
msgstr "室内飞行指南"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:7 53c0786140c24f32823237064848b434
msgid ""
"This article provides guidelines for flying your multicopter inside without "
"any position or velocity source (e.g. no GPS, no optical flow). For indoor "
"flight using a non-GPS position or velocity source please refer to the "
":ref:`Non-GPS Navigation <common-non-gps-navigation-landing-page>` page."
msgstr ""
"本文为在没有任何位置或速度源（例如：无GPS、无光流）的情况下在室内飞行多旋翼提供指导。关于使用非GPS定位或速度源的室内飞行，请参阅 "
":ref:`Non-GPS Navigation <common-non-gps-navigation-landing-page>` 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:12 c62abb7ba9174abe8ab6a8c23626b348
msgid ""
"When flying indoors make sure you have plenty of space and follow safety "
"procedures."
msgstr "在室内飞行时，请确保有足够的空间并遵守安全规程。"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:14 313d099b2ef044bfa75e180ac1bc304d
msgid "GPS does not work indoors and needs to be disabled (no exceptions)"
msgstr "GPS在室内无法工作，必须禁用（无例外）。"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:17 0d137fd27a2540a7a80b83601301fe13
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:19 ea925d12d9c74cce9ed50439443ab2ab
msgid ""
"The main point note when flying indoors is that Global Positioning Systems "
"will not work. Even if you see that you have the correct number of "
"satellites and a low HDOP, this is due to multipathing of the signals from "
"the satellites. This means the single is being reflected to the antenna via "
"walls, windows and other surfaces from outside. If you look at the position "
"on a map you will see that the location will not match your current "
"location, or will be drifting, at time many meters or even 1000s of metres "
"from your location."
msgstr ""
"在室内飞行时需要注意的主要一点是全球定位系统无法正常工作。即使您看到卫星数量正确且HDOP较低，这也是由于卫星信号多径反射造成的。信号通过外部的墙壁、窗户和其他表面反射到天线。如果您在地图上查看位置，会发现显示位置与实际位置不符，或者不断漂移，有时甚至与实际位置相差数米乃至数千米。"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:29 aa133efeb4ce41f9944d5746c3b018a0
msgid "Stabilize"
msgstr "Stabilize"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:31 685f3fbec96c4ce6aea1a38744e788b9
msgid ""
":ref:`Stabilize <stabilize-mode>` mode does not use GPS, and has the least "
"problems, but the pilot will need good control of the copter."
msgstr ":ref:`Stabilize <stabilize-mode>` 模式不使用GPS，问题最少，但飞手需要对飞机有良好的控制能力。"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:35 6b37a82458ef463e92521bbbf270dca1
msgid "Altitude Hold"
msgstr "高度保持"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:37 a7337a41bf0e463593c2aba16e0dc3da
msgid ""
":ref:`Altitude Hold <altholdmode>` mode use the barometer to hold a specific"
" altitude. The barometer relies on a constant air pressure. Air-pressure in "
"a room can change due to doors opening or closing. Also climate control "
"devices like fans and air-conditioning will also cause pressure changes. The"
" likely outcome is a sudden crash in the floor or ceiling."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Altitude Hold <altholdmode>` "
"模式使用气压计来保持特定高度。气压计依赖于稳定的气压。房间内的气压可能因门的开关而改变，风扇和空调等气候控制设备也会导致气压变化。可能的后果是飞机突然撞向地板或天花板。"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:45 72785ce9611f4647a0393d74c9fe935c
msgid "Sonar or Lidar"
msgstr "声呐或激光雷达"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:47 51fd6cbe93ab408383905b22b8a190ca
msgid ""
"Using a downward facing :ref:`sonar or lidar <common-rangefinder-"
"landingpage>` when flying in :ref:`AltHold <altholdmode>` can help avoid "
"sudden changes in altitude causing crashes into the floor or ceiling.  See "
":ref:`Surface Tracking <terrain-following-manual-modes>` for more details."
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`AltHold <altholdmode>` 模式下飞行时，使用朝下的 :ref:`声呐或激光雷达 <common-"
"rangefinder-landingpage>` 有助于避免高度突变导致飞机撞向地板或天花板。详细信息请参阅 :ref:`Surface "
"Tracking <terrain-following-manual-modes>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:50 e9c497c4a8f642cab08179ec177a890e
msgid "Safe Indoor Flying Dos"
msgstr "室内安全飞行注意事项（应做）"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:52 70c0598a2f914737bdcaee996866fbc4
msgid "Disable the GPS by setting :ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` to 0"
msgstr "通过将 :ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` 设置为0来禁用GPS。"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:53 9cfc23301fc74f528c3fe5aa8b04e410
msgid ""
"Configure the :ref:`battery failsafe <failsafe-battery>` to \"Land\" by "
"setting :ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT <BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` = 1"
msgstr ""
"通过设置 :ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT <BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` = 1，将 :ref:`电池失控保护 <failsafe-"
"battery>` 配置为\"降落\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:54 f10fdb7700ff490295d5e3c83eeb3a92
msgid ""
"Configure the :ref:`radio failsafe <radio-failsafe>` to \"Enabled always "
"Land\" by setting :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE <FS_THR_ENABLE>` = 3"
msgstr ""
"通过设置 :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE <FS_THR_ENABLE>` = 3，将 :ref:`遥控失控保护 <radio-"
"failsafe>` 配置为\"始终启用并降落\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:55 2151906db6d9463690970a131e28a99d
msgid ""
"Disable the :ref:`fence <common-geofencing-landing-page>` by setting "
":ref:`FENCE_ENABLE <FENCE_ENABLE>` = 0"
msgstr ""
"通过设置 :ref:`FENCE_ENABLE <FENCE_ENABLE>` = 0来禁用 :ref:`围栏 <common-geofencing-"
"landing-page>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:56 bfceb39e2aa34066b33d8bd4faca8450
msgid "Use a downward facing sonar or lidar (if available)"
msgstr "使用朝下的声呐或激光雷达（如有）。"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:59 406c736208a742899dd0379955ce8e38
msgid "Safe Indoor Flying Don'ts"
msgstr "室内安全飞行注意事项（禁止）"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:61 82699eaf001a4c748745d5984387c297
msgid ""
"Don't fly in small confined spaces. Use common sense, flying inside a "
"warehouse with a high roof = OK, bedroom = not OK."
msgstr "不要在狭小的密闭空间内飞行。请运用常识判断：在高屋顶的仓库内飞行=可以，在卧室内飞行=不可以。"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:63 95ed2d4c465c4177ae2d1a2749330bbd
msgid "Don't use Auto\\* modes"
msgstr "不要使用Auto\\*模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:65 7d95772b146b4a5291fec5f3d33a9c58
msgid ""
"\\* Autonomous and semi-autonomous modes require a position estimate. This "
"can come from GPS or from :ref:`Non-GPS Navigation <common-non-gps-"
"navigation-landing-page>` sources such as optical flow, external navigation,"
" or motion capture systems. In ArduPilot 4.7 and later, the EKF origin can "
"be automatically saved and restored across power cycles — see "
":ref:`Persistent Origin Storage <common-non-gps-navigation-landing-page>` "
"for details."
msgstr ""
"\\* 自主和半自主模式需要位置估计。位置估计可来自 GPS，或来自光流、外部导航、动作捕捉系统等 :ref:`非 GPS 导航 <common-"
"non-gps-navigation-landing-page>` 来源。在 ArduPilot 4.7 及更高版本中，EKF "
"原点可在断电重启后自动保存和恢复——详见 :ref:`持久化原点存储 <common-non-gps-navigation-landing-"
"page>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/indoor-flying.rst:67 64a8a1dc83ec4ad2a54fb58cce3a4dd0
msgid ""
"\\*\\* Non-autonomous modes include :ref:`Stabilize <stabilize-mode>` and "
":ref:`AltHold <altholdmode>`"
msgstr ""
"\\*\\* 非自主模式包括 :ref:`Stabilize <stabilize-mode>` 和 :ref:`AltHold "
"<altholdmode>`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\\* Autonomous and semi-autonomous modes requires GPS (e.g. :ref:`Loiter "
#~ "<loiter-mode>`, :ref:`Guided <ac2_guidedmode>`, :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>`, "
#~ ":ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`)"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\\* 自主及半自主模式需要GPS（例如：:ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>`、:ref:`Guided "
#~ "<ac2_guidedmode>`、:ref:`Auto <auto-mode>`、:ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`）。"
